  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MKN-Indigenous Peoples&#x2019; Rights and Culture in The Republic of Congo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project based in the local and national church together with local/national Indigenous People Groups and organisations, other NGOs and local and national authorities, will have as its objective that the indigenous people groups in the project area live in harmonious coexistence with the bantu populations</narrative>
  </description>
